  "processing_chain": [
    "1. Parse MIDI file (mido library)",
    "2. Extract note events with absolute timing per track",
    "3. For each track, select formant preset based on instrument name",
    "4. For each MIDI note, synthesize FOF wave-packets at fundamental frequency",
    "5. Apply ADSR envelope (8ms attack, 30ms decay, 0.6 sustain, 40ms release)",
    "6. Add 2ms jitter to trigger timing for humanization",
    "7. Sum all formant channels per track",
    "8. Normalize each track stem to 0.7 peak",
    "9. Sum all track stems into master mix",
    "10. Normalize master mix to -1dB peak (0.89 linear)",
    "11. Export WAV (16-bit PCM, 44.1kHz, mono)",
    "12. Convert to OGG (Opus codec, 48kbps, VOIP application)",
    "13. Copy source MIDI for reference"
